      "before": "Every ready/reconnect replaced interview:revision:global; reconnecting open SDK sockets could be abandoned.",
      "after": "SET NX initializes only a missing revision; retain the SDK reconnecting socket and existing bounded command client. Ordered durable revision replay cannot overwrite a later counter."
